{"ID":"20230925151104-ovf9y0h","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20230925151104-ovf9y0h","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925151104-ovf9y0h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925152919-whef21i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240226082235-cxd5bm9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:8240,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925152919-whef21i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"方便法门","type":"doc","updated":"20240913131729"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925152919-wwrn3mv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-wwrn3mv","updated":"20231008151807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1、治疗戴阳：通脉四逆汤和白通汤（就是用有生附子的药比较能够治疗戴阳）"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-h8xw6t4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-h8xw6t4","updated":"20231008151808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、奔豚：桂枝加桂汤（胸口附近奔豚）；苓桂枣甘汤（奔豚气，只在小腹，没有冲过腹部）；奔豚汤（旁开侧面出现的奔豚气）；苓桂味甘汤（阳虚的奔豚证）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-zp4ri6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-zp4ri6r","updated":"20231008151809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、痰饮头晕：苓桂术甘汤（中焦有痰，血虚除外；坐着要站起来就头晕）；泽泻汤（血中有痰，坐着就感觉天旋地转）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-zk2qiqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-zk2qiqf","updated":"20231008151809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、下阴会湿：真武汤暖命门后，没完全好则苓桂枣味甘汤处理下中焦的水，没完全好则补三焦，用补中益气汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-muqhfoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-muqhfoa","updated":"20231008151811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、小青龙汤较好的收工药：苓甘五味姜辛汤、苓甘五味姜辛夏汤、苓甘五味姜辛夏仁汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-d044j4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-d044j4i","updated":"20231008151812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、调三焦的药：温胆汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-g63b5l9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-g63b5l9","updated":"20231008151813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、肺痈：桔梗汤；如果是肺痈初期，即正在发炎要化脓的时候，可用苇茎汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-qix7qlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-qix7qlq","updated":"20231008151814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、肺萎：要变成肺萎，可用麦门冬汤滋阴试试；如正式变成肺萎，炙甘草汤；肺冷不完全的肺萎，甘草干姜汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-nj587ok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-nj587ok","updated":"20231008151815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9、肠痈：肠子化脓，脓已形成；薏苡附子败酱散（阑尾炎、盲肠炎、痔疮也有效，也是大肠癌保养方）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-vpktli7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-vpktli7","updated":"20231008151818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10、肺胀：喘，上气，目如脱状，脉浮大，胸满而涨，用越婢加半夏汤；咳而上气，烦躁而喘，脉浮者，用小青龙加石膏汤；肺、脸、鼻腔面目塞住勉强属于肺胀一类的，用葶苈大枣泻肺汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ntvp1ha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ntvp1ha","updated":"20231008151818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11、青光眼：眼压过高导致，可在调和水的药方如苓桂术甘汤或真武汤中加三钱葶苈子；一天分两三次喝；石斛夜光丸（久服）；附子理中汤加吴茱萸；苓桂术甘汤加吴茱萸加车前子；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-1w6qb8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-1w6qb8p","updated":"20231008151819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11.1、结膜炎、角膜炎：吴茱萸汤（肝寒型）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-jjfeqnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-jjfeqnc","updated":"20231008151820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12、肾结石：猪苓汤、茯苓戎盐汤（倪海厦喜欢猪苓汤搭配茯苓戎盐汤使用）；如无用，可以加一钱葶苈子试试；（食疗）嚼核桃，细嚼慢咽，持续几个月；八正散；（如痛风内陷成肾结石，需要从痛风治）；大建中汤（结石导致的肚子痛）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-stzegv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-stzegv6","updated":"20231008151822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"13、渗出性胸膜炎：葶苈大枣泻肺汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-fcxx4is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-fcxx4is","updated":"20231008151822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"14、胎毒：生甘草煮水服用可去胎毒。"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-bu0c33c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-bu0c33c","updated":"20231008151823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"15、婴儿服用生地黄汁（也可干地黄泡水打汁），吃后会下黑粪，据说未来总会发一次的麻疹或什么水痘就不会再发了。"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-sc6w579","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-sc6w579","updated":"20231008151824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16、内出血：黄土汤。"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ndco6me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ndco6me","updated":"20231008151824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17、三天两头的感冒：不要吃肾气丸或地黄丸（会吃成吴茱萸汤证，黏住邪气，烦躁欲死），可以吃薯蓣丸"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hnkpwpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hnkpwpm","updated":"20231008151825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18、补血方：炙甘草汤、朱鸟汤、内补当归建中汤、温经汤；桂枝龙骨牡蛎汤（血干的人吃了会血热，可换服二加龙骨牡蛎汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-7677or9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-7677or9","updated":"20231008151826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19、便秘：小孩子便秘用生白术，女人便秘用白芍，老人便秘用麻仁、肉苁蓉；大多种子仁类都用润肠通便的作用，如黑芝麻、花生仁之类；麻仁白蜜煎；代赭石加当归肉苁蓉；蜜煎导；麻子仁丸（脾约型便秘）；补中益气汤加肉苁蓉（适合老人）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-2m0c02s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-2m0c02s","updated":"20231008151828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"20、尿道发炎、尿血：薏苡仁植物的根，打汁服用；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ai1j9yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ai1j9yh","updated":"20231008151828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21、盗汗：阳虚盗汗，桂枝加附子汤；阴虚盗汗，当归六黄汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-nb8vsq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-nb8vsq2","updated":"20231008151829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22、肝阴虚：一贯煎（适用小柴胡汤劫肝阴，可补回肝阴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-81916g0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-81916g0","updated":"20231008151830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23、胃痛：一贯煎（热性胃痛）；香砂理中汤（寒性胃痛）；半夏泻心汤（寒热交杂的胃痛）；（大致方向）；三合汤（上腹部胃脘处）；理中汤；乌梅加甘草汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-5ozkbz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-5ozkbz7","updated":"20231008151831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24、肺痈之后补肺：白芨、合欢皮；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-m07ldgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-m07ldgq","updated":"20231008151831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"25、心绞痛：瓜蒌薤白白酒汤、瓜蒌薤白半夏汤"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-a1dvzj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-a1dvzj1","updated":"20231008151832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26、血崩漏：可使用带有当归黄芪的补血汤，补血且让血有力量收住血；赤石脂加海螵鞘（乌贼鱼骨头）加侧柏叶打粉和热饭食用；赤石脂加干姜胡椒；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-bcmxl5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-bcmxl5a","updated":"20231008151833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26.1、月经量多：补骨脂加赤石脂做药丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-enligtf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-enligtf","updated":"20231008151834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27、破伤风（金创）：川穹（川穹可以驱出血中之风）；傅青主的蝉衣酒（知了壳煮黄酒），服后随汗出即愈；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-cj8gg3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-cj8gg3f","updated":"20231008151834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28、产后虚脱：佛手散"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-8hztwin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-8hztwin","updated":"20231008151836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28.1、产后抽风：山茱萸和山药各二两煮水；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-o78r3t2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-o78r3t2","updated":"20231008151837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28.2、产后无奶：三母散（贝母、牡蛎、知母）配上猪脚炖汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-nb5p8e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-nb5p8e2","updated":"20231008151839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28.3、难产：宝生无忧散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ddidyat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ddidyat","updated":"20231008151840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28.4、习惯性流产：白术散（安胎方）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-6051sxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-6051sxu","updated":"20231008151841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28.5、动到胎气：三个生鸡蛋黄调一钱朱砂粉吞服（活胎则安胎，死胎则会堕胎，朱砂用酒吞服也能打死胎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-96aahcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-96aahcg","updated":"20231008151842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28.6、产后血入于肺，面黑发喘欲死者：参苏饮；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-nklm5xv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-nklm5xv","updated":"20231008151843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29、顺产方：开骨散"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-35hivgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-35hivgr","updated":"20231008151844"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29.1、瘦胎散：枳壳四两，甘草二两打粉，每次一钱热水吞服；（该方小孩出生后会有些黑瘦，多养几天就会恢复）；或白术与枳壳等分，做成药丸吞服（白术利腰脐间血）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-op15g2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-op15g2y","updated":"20231008151845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29.2、产后肚子绞痛：枳实芍药散（芍药让平滑肌放松，枳实让平滑肌收缩）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hs1ckn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hs1ckn5","updated":"20231008151846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29.3、回乳方：两碗水煮两到五钱花椒，煮成一碗加二两红糖调，每天顿服一碗；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ijxp477","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ijxp477","updated":"20231008151847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29.4、产后肚子痛：失笑散（蒲黄跟五灵脂一比一）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-9t2qh3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-9t2qh3q","updated":"20231008151848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30、头痛：川穹茶调散（血虚风证，搭配当归补血汤使用）；炮附子跟海盐打粉，哪痛搓哪；吴茱萸汤（痰痛）；清震汤（雷头风痛；脑壳堵塞胀痛，脑袋里能听到类似打雷的隆响）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-mtqu4k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-mtqu4k8","updated":"20231008151850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"31、肚子胀：厚朴生姜半夏甘草人参汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-jya99bn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-jya99bn","updated":"20231008151856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"32、胃胀：枳术汤、桔皮枳实生姜汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-vtloi71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-vtloi71","updated":"20231008151857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"33、胆结石：枳壳是胆结石专病专药，药里面加枳壳，胆结石容易排出来；柴胡芍药枳实甘草汤；大柴胡汤（排石过程剧痛痛；）；柴胡加芒硝汤；四逆散（适合长期服用可加味鸡内金、海金沙、郁金、金钱草）；芍药甘草汤（临时应对胆结石剧痛）；茵陈蒿汤（有茵陈蒿汤证）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-vyf5lx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-vyf5lx6","updated":"20231008151858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34、子宫肌瘤：桂枝茯苓丸（苓桂结构可帮助膀胱气化）"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-0py7qm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-0py7qm9","updated":"20231008151859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35、眼压高：苓桂术甘汤加牛膝车前子；真武汤；当作一种水代谢不良的情况处理；没用的话可以加味葶苈子；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-y9ychsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-y9ychsj","updated":"20231008151859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"36、飞蚊症：苓桂术甘汤加茜草红花；当作眼睛里面有水的渣滓，即痰饮处理；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ximxol8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ximxol8","updated":"20231008151900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37、脑虚：防眩汤；益气聪明汤跟温胆汤同用（因劳累导致的脑虚）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-46xpo0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-46xpo0q","updated":"20231008151902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38、落枕、后脑勺僵、颈椎病特效药：益气聪明汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hojq78s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hojq78s","updated":"20231008151902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"39、心脏病/胸口闷痛：木防己汤（脸色发黑胃发胀）；栝蒌薤白白酒汤（心痛胸痛彻背）；栝蒌薤白半夏汤（心痛胸痛彻背）；枳实薤白桂枝厚朴汤（也可治瓣膜病；痛的感觉比较靠到肋骨）；桂枝人参汤（也可治瓣膜病，理中汤加桂枝，痛的感觉比较靠到肋骨）；茯苓杏仁甘草汤（作用点比较在肺，发气喘透不过气，心跳砰砰撞击胸口）、橘皮枳实生姜汤（作用点比较在肺，发气喘透不过气，喉咙塞到或胃胀）；薏苡附子散（胸口偶尔又不剧烈的心绞痛）；乌头赤石脂丸（心痛彻背，背痛彻心，心绞痛到送医急救的地步）；生姜桂枝枳实汤（心脏被什么勒到下扯，内脏下垂的感觉）；旋覆花汤（寒气结在肝脏，胸部喜欢人按或踩）；半夏麻黄丸（心跳时感觉胃跟心脏撞到一起，有一种心悸感）；木防己汤（心脏病发作时人容易喘，脸发黑，水结在胸肋）；苓桂术甘汤（痰饮导致的心脏病）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ym5kc5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ym5kc5d","updated":"20231008151903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40、肌肉纤维化（嚼槟榔）：麦门冬汤加补中益气汤加桔梗加芍药（辩证详见 肌肉纤维化）"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-6csb6kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-6csb6kb","updated":"20231008151904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"41、冠心病：苓桂茜红汤（舌头边或底下有深蓝色瘀斑）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kryyupi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kryyupi","updated":"20231008151906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42、比较干、比较热的痰饮：雪羹；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-dg15021","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-dg15021","updated":"20231008151907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"43、热症的高血压造成的青光眼：苓桂术甘汤；雪羹"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-q5w4i3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-q5w4i3l","updated":"20231008151907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"44、脚痛走不动路：芍药甘草汤；微寒，可加附子中和，也可加生姜消肿；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hectbpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hectbpq","updated":"20231008151908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45、手脚冰冷：四逆汤、肾气丸（长期服用）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kqni979","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kqni979","updated":"20231008151909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46、手指冰冷：当归四逆汤"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-agixbuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-agixbuv","updated":"20231008151909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"47、月经痛\\体虚怕冷：芍药甘草附子汤、小建中汤；温经汤；当归芍药散；当归生姜羊肉汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-op00ewr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-op00ewr","updated":"20231008151910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48、茯苓四逆汤（可辩证尝试）：心脏衰竭、心肌梗塞、心律失常、慢性肠胃炎"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-owaj7wq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-owaj7wq","updated":"20231008151911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"49、膀胱癌（辩证尝试加味）：五苓散、桃核承气汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-9jnlw32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-9jnlw32","updated":"20231008151911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"50、消渴加水逆：茯苓泽泻汤、"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-rx26sam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-rx26sam","updated":"20231008151913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51、拉肚子：五苓散（任何形式拉肚子，都可以外挂五苓散试下）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-8khxera","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-8khxera","updated":"20231008151913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"52、食物中毒：五苓散（可试用五苓散）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-2v0whor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-2v0whor","updated":"20231008151914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53、羊癫疯\\癫痫病：五苓散；真武汤；（食疗方）十斤生橄榄，煮软后去核，剩下药汤汁倒出，加水继续煮，煮到水没有橄榄味为止，再将所有药汤汁一起浓缩收膏，大火转小火久煮收膏差不到一碗量，再而加八钱白矾调和；服用方法：早晚各服用三钱，调热水里面化开喝掉（或煮软后用果汁机之类机器直接打浆，开火收干制造成果酱，再加明矾调和）；（轻症状）白矾磨粉，沾橄榄吃；风引汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-sp8pz7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-sp8pz7b","updated":"20231008151915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53.1、脑膜炎后的发神经：风引汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-fw9wgjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-fw9wgjl","updated":"20231008151916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54、阴囊水肿：五苓散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-u0uki0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-u0uki0e","updated":"20231008151917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54.1、五苓散：可作肾脏病保养药使用；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-2us80p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-2us80p8","updated":"20231008151918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"55、驱邪：信灵香；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ihci2im","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ihci2im","updated":"20231008151919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56、食道发炎：栀子甘草豉汤（有胸中窒感觉）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-d2kakfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-d2kakfk","updated":"20231008151920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"57、胃酸过多导致的胃部灼痛：栀子炒焦打粉，加生姜汁一起吞；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ngwua7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ngwua7p","updated":"20231008151920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58、跌打损伤导致的肉红肿：吊筋药（生栀子粉末加面粉，40度以上酒弄糊，敷在伤口肿的地方）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-6d1etqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-6d1etqp","updated":"20231008151922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"59、流鼻血：栀子粉烧灰，然后吹入鼻中；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-l3l0fzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-l3l0fzu","updated":"20231008151924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"60、健忘：人参、茯苓、远志、菖蒲；或龟甲粉、龙骨粉、远志、菖蒲（效果更好，较难消化）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-vbh2vh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-vbh2vh0","updated":"20231008151925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"61、肌无力：平胃散"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-y028fuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-y028fuv","updated":"20231008151926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62、子宫下垂：枳实和益母草（也叫茺蔚子）；提垂汤（升麻、柴胡、枳实、益母草）；两方都比较伤气，所以需补气，需加足量黄芪黄芪；平胃散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-jytytgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-jytytgd","updated":"20231008151927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63、中暑：六一散（滑石跟甘草组成）；竹叶石膏汤；白虎加人参汤（怕冷，阳暑）；前两者可以加黄芪或生脉散补气；一物瓜蒂汤（阴暑）；香薷饮（阴暑）或四味香薷饮；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ovhofcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ovhofcw","updated":"20231008151928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"64、黄汗：桂枝加黄芪汤（髋关节病症特效药，该汤剂可用于日常保养）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-qm9l037","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-qm9l037","updated":"20231008151929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"65、肾衰竭\\肾坏死\\水毒肿：真武汤；人参养荣汤加肉苁蓉巴戟天等；肾气丸；炖猪腰；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-d1u6u97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-d1u6u97","updated":"20231008151930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66、扁桃腺发炎/烂掉（少阴）：麻黄附子细心汤（初期，麻黄2细辛2附子3）；夏枯草煮鸡蛋（适用小孩，少阳病）"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-or0ygky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-or0ygky","updated":"20231008151931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"67、急性水肿、腹水肿：麻黄甘草汤；十枣汤（急性）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-j7newia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-j7newia","updated":"20231008151931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"67.1、肝硬化、慢性水肿：大黄蛰虫丸把硬掉的肝融掉，再用真武汤退水肿；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hmjtmii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hmjtmii","updated":"20231008151932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"68、白内障：肾气丸；肾气丸加味枳术丸加磁石（久服）；磁朱丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-notnf4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-notnf4l","updated":"20231008151933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"69、耳聋、眼盲、高血压、肾阳虚型心肾不交失眠、尿失禁：真武汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-4pjsh76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-4pjsh76","updated":"20231008151934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"70、带状疱疹/水疱：五苓散；瓜蒌红花汤；天门冬跟米酒捣成捣糊，三分之二敷在疱疹处，三分之一温水吞服；小续命汤（带状孢疹残留的痛）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-wkrjexg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-wkrjexg","updated":"20231008151940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71、荨麻疹：桂麻各半汤；桂二越一汤；麻黄连翘赤小豆汤加桑白皮加蝉蜕；当归四逆汤（挂到厥阴经）；升麻鳖甲汤（冷性荨麻疹）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-is5j8u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-is5j8u6","updated":"20231008151941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72、白带：真武汤；完带汤（较快，也适用带脉受损肚子肥的男生）；禹余粮加干姜；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-uwg9atn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-uwg9atn","updated":"20231008151942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73、老人家冬天容易皮肤发痒，属阳虚：真武汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-r8a9i65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-r8a9i65","updated":"20231008151943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"74、夏天皮肤容易发痒，属热气出不来，麻黄汤系范畴；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-s6s3pyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-s6s3pyi","updated":"20231008151943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"75、糖尿病脚部溃烂：黄砂糖泡水泡脚；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-7iegxhe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-7iegxhe","updated":"20231008151944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76、冠状动脉淤塞，心肌梗塞（吃盐太少导致）：从脾阴实治，脾阴实传心阴实，用胃苓汤，一天一剂 ；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-mkep742","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-mkep742","updated":"20231008151945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"77、高血压：真武汤；镇肝熄风汤（辩证而用，三贴无效换真武汤）；四逆汤能临时降血压，但主要还是靠真武汤将之彻底治愈才不会再犯；吴茱萸汤（高血压的眩晕，肝阴实的高血压）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-u278jwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-u278jwe","updated":"20231008151946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"78、糖尿病：肾气丸（阴阳两虚）、栝蒌翟麦薯蓣丸（滋阴清热补肾阳，治本）、真武汤（去芍药加乌梅枸杞三钱，生姜改干姜一两，补阳）、理中汤（加味肉桂粉加乌梅）、白虎加参汤（降血糖）；红糖煮水20分钟（食疗，煮久入里），当茶喝；精米饭（食疗，精米入里，糙米杂粮米补不进去；精米如蓬莱米、月光米，可加点地瓜、山药更容易补入体内）；五苓散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-nxwg0yq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-nxwg0yq","updated":"20231008151948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"78.1、糖尿病导致的脚麻木无感觉：真武汤加白虎汤；（附子要放多）"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-dicvzgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-dicvzgu","updated":"20231008151950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"79、骨质疏松：桂枝加术附汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-sta72al","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-sta72al","updated":"20231008151957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80、脂肪肝：实脾散；逍遥散煎剂（白术、黄精、三七加量两三钱）"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-uqzq719","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-uqzq719","updated":"20231008151958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"81、脖颈酸痛：葛根汤；葛根汤效果不好时，可用椒附散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-wvq5rlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-wvq5rlh","updated":"20231008151959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"82、慢性水肿：鲤鱼红豆汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-161e9mh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-161e9mh","updated":"20231008151959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"83、香港脚：下体湿热导致，二妙散；三妙散；情志论：脾气暴躁导致，调整心情也有概率能好；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-t17dqep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-t17dqep","updated":"20231008152000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"84、尿完后膀胱抽痛：禹余粮丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-z4an9o5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-z4an9o5","updated":"20231008152002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"85、祛疤：用布将疤擦得红热，然后生半夏和禹余粮一起弄成粉调在鸡蛋黄里，将之涂在疤上，每日两次，据说可祛疤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-vkcfqbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-vkcfqbn","updated":"20231008152003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86、盲肠炎：当归四逆加吴茱萸生姜汤（百分之八十）；大黄牡丹皮汤或薏苡附子败酱散（百分之二十）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-z3q7w9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-z3q7w9t","updated":"20231008152003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87、乳腺发炎：葛根汤（初期）；柴胡汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-eictw2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-eictw2b","updated":"20231008152004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"88、淋巴癌：十六味流气饮（较有效）；五香连翘汤（十六味流气饮偏刚燥，医到一定程度患者有红肿热痛发炎时，可换为五香连翘汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-u3kijv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-u3kijv5","updated":"20231008152005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"89、减肥：补气消痰饮；敲击胆经；当归四逆加萸姜附汤（肉肥）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-6bwrshx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-6bwrshx","updated":"20231008152005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"90、 疟疾＼血稠＼胶原病：柴胡汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-rxp1y86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-rxp1y86","updated":"20231008152006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"91、打嗝：吃个柿子蒂；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-sxz1z5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-sxz1z5x","updated":"20231008152007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"92、补脑方：补中益气汤（疏导三焦气往上走）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-qrb69w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-qrb69w3","updated":"20231008152008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"93、尿失禁：甘草干姜汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-b3irddc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-b3irddc","updated":"20231008152009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"94、切掉胆的病人：可能会困惑混乱，没有判断力，可以常服温胆汤，无副作用；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-3nt01jk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-3nt01jk","updated":"20231008152011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"95、胆有病的人善叹息：喜欢叹气；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-w433q3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-w433q3f","updated":"20231008152011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"96、中耳积水或耳朵流脓：小柴胡汤加石膏桔梗（治脓）；小柴胡汤加五苓散（治积水）；小柴胡加平胃散（治眩晕）；泽泻汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-zvp7cfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-zvp7cfm","updated":"20231008152012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"97、血粘稠：小柴胡汤（可以让血变得不粘稠，就是把血打干净）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-yx6cmj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-yx6cmj3","updated":"20231008152013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"98、妇人经期感冒：柴胡汤（较大概率能对症）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-q4t3vyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-q4t3vyp","updated":"20231008152014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99、外伤药：黄连粉（黄连一两，薏仁五钱，白术五钱，冬瓜仁三钱）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-bmfizi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-bmfizi2","updated":"20240228081913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"100、失眠：温胆汤（无差别可用方，百分之七十有效）；栀子汤（心烦睡不着，淡淡的想事情失眠）；朱鸟汤（烦躁的睡不着）；酸枣仁汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-m2oikrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-m2oikrj","updated":"20231008152015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101、晕车：小柴胡加苓桂术甘汤；温胆汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-f6vttxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-f6vttxk","updated":"20231008152016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102、B型肝炎：逍遥散加香砂六君子汤（久服能改善）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-rio52mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-rio52mp","updated":"20231008152017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"103、男性有乳房：逍遥散加味健脾加味祛痰药（解决思路，如加茯苓，牡蛎壳，白芥子等）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-07z3on1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-07z3on1","updated":"20231008152018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"104、更年期综合症：温经汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-8asfweg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-8asfweg","updated":"20231008152020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105、挡癌症：补中益气汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-dtigmif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-dtigmif","updated":"20231008152021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"106、熬夜导致的口腔溃疡：补中益气汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ophp1ib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ophp1ib","updated":"20231008152022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"107、忧郁症（闷闷的不哭不笑）：益肝散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-whef21i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-whef21i","updated":"20231008152023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"108、急性败血症：柴葛解肌汤（柴胡、葛根、生石膏三味药都用到现代剂量至少一两）（可加味一两蒲公英，五钱白花蛇舌草，山豆根三钱，黄芩加到五钱）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ksspbsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ksspbsc","updated":"20231008152024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"109、腮腺炎：柴胡清肝汤加普济消毒饮；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-a3srwi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-a3srwi4","updated":"20231008152025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"110、月经失调：加味逍遥散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-mzr2lhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-mzr2lhd","updated":"20231008152026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"111、胁痛：小柴胡汤（左右胁痛皆可）；柴胡芍药枳实甘草汤（左右胁痛皆可）；四逆散（左右胁痛皆可）；左金丸（左胁痛；肝经受邪不通畅，把肝血疏通，让肝气能够通上来。左升）；柴胡疏肝汤（左胁痛）；姜黄枳壳桂心炙甘草陈皮半夏（右胁痛，半夏降逆，枳壳往下坠，桂心补心阳往下压，陈皮行气，姜黄右胁痛专病专药。右降）"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-vokmw5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-vokmw5o","updated":"20231008152026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"112、脾肿大：归脾汤（补心阴心阳）；鳖甲煎丸；牡蛎壳（特效药）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-0mfwmq1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-0mfwmq1","updated":"20231008152028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113、年老身体收缩变矮：当归、芍药、熟地、柴胡、白术、肉桂、白栀子---石室秘录；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-33prw72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-33prw72","updated":"20231008152028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114、全身发紧：大秦艽汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-nkd60q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-nkd60q1","updated":"20231008152030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"115、眼干红痛：真武汤；六味地黄汤加柴胡白芍当归干菊花等..."}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-6gw6bxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-6gw6bxj","updated":"20231008152031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"116、疝气：吴茱萸汤；橘核茴香丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ttn4xp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ttn4xp5","updated":"20231008152032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"116.1、肚子不平有突起（疝气）：大建中汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-if97e4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-if97e4a","updated":"20231008152033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"117、容易发怒生气：解怒补肝汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-gvx5bdu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-gvx5bdu","updated":"20231008152034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"118、胆小怕事：助勇丹；柴胡加龙骨牡蛎汤（恐慌症、心灵创伤之类的症状）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-6teimv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-6teimv5","updated":"20231008152034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"119、男性性欲强（可通过补阳药处理）：肾气丸；小建中汤；桂枝加附子汤；理中汤等；天王补心丹；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-zbkb79v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-zbkb79v","updated":"20231008152036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"120、女性性欲强/不满足：散花丹；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-q2ft7qu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-q2ft7qu","updated":"20231008152036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"121、骨蒸（少阳区块阴虚发热、气虚发热；骨头发热）：补中益气汤；方剂中加牡丹皮（走里经，治疗不出汗的骨蒸），方剂中加地骨皮（走表经，治疗出汗的骨蒸），临床上可共用，可多加牡丹皮，少加地骨皮；（可加味鳖甲，鳖甲能让药性钻进去）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-5bpoaqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-5bpoaqs","updated":"20231008152044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"122、左手不能动的中风：可能是肝胆之气郁结的中风，需疏肝解郁；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-y5myben","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-y5myben","updated":"20231008152045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123、肝火旺，过于生气以致吐血：三黄泻心汤（大黄、黄芩、黄连，热开水冲一下就喝，煮久会变泻药）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-jpwvyv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-jpwvyv9","updated":"20231008152046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124、晕车药：温胆汤（科学中药）；小柴胡汤（科学中药）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-qyxz46o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-qyxz46o","updated":"20231008152046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125、胆囊炎、胆管炎、胰腺炎：大柴胡汤；柴胡加芒消汤（清热散火强一点，泻下效果小一点）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-1ck3opg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-1ck3opg","updated":"20231008152047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126、肠梗阻：四逆散（保养方）；萝卜芒硝汤（也可叫朴硝汤，该方可拿来治痰火癫狂）；大柴胡汤（呕吐剧烈）；大承气汤（需不会吐，阳明腑燥实的肠梗阻）；三物备急丸；蜣螂七只、牵牛子3钱、石菖蒲3钱，上三味，用水煮，一天分两次喝；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-d3mx051","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-d3mx051","updated":"20231008152048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"127、十二指肠溃疡、胃溃疡：黄芪建中汤；归脾汤（轻症胃溃疡）；五灵脂跟红参；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kzc48h3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kzc48h3","updated":"20231008152048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"128、女劳疸（跟许多男人上床，身体闷住热毒）：硝石矾石散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-flqmj3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-flqmj3m","updated":"20231008152049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"129、阑尾炎/盲肠炎：大柴胡汤合桃核承气汤；当归四逆汤加吴茱萸生姜（手足厥寒，脉细）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-y3j3gz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-y3j3gz0","updated":"20231008152051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"130、痔疮便血：当归赤豆散（排浓汤）；大承气汤加当归槐花；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-7gpt6cd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-7gpt6cd","updated":"20231008152051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"131、月经频繁（不止一次）：黄瓜根散；土瓜根散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-4v406bf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-4v406bf","updated":"20231008152054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"132、月经崩下：胶姜汤（止血补血）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-bkrhdhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-bkrhdhv","updated":"20231008152054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133、阳痿：柴胡加龙骨牡蛎汤；四逆散（宋本伤寒论，肝气郁结导致的阳痿）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ksnk7b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ksnk7b1","updated":"20231008152055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"134、感冒强行发汗造成的火逆：桂枝救逆汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-qhc29y1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-qhc29y1","updated":"20231008152056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"135、戴阳：白通汤；通脉四逆汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-dsc944p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-dsc944p","updated":"20231008152057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"136、阴虚型火逆：人身地黄龙骨牡蛎茯苓汤方；（不用阳药治火逆的条文，需辩证）"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-q6ztniv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-q6ztniv","updated":"20231008152058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"137、张志顺三绝方之一：七枝灵（七叶一枝花、妞子七、灵芝；可加入任意药方中，三药合用则调和身体，起保健作用）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-bx48jr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-bx48jr3","updated":"20240301155758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"138、手汗：桂甘龙牡汤（如果易脚汗，可加引经药牛膝或用桂枝加桂汤加龙骨牡蛎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-5gedzgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-5gedzgq","updated":"20231008152104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"139、脑部淤血：生水蛭粉（可做成胶囊吞服）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ie4260t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ie4260t","updated":"20231008152103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"140、甲状腺亢进：桂甘龙牡汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hjfbdgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hjfbdgv","updated":"20231008152105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"141、脸部抽筋：黄鳝血（涂未抽筋的半张脸）；黄芪五物汤；葛根汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-n7z0j05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-n7z0j05","updated":"20231008152107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"142、中风/手脚麻痹/美容：黄芪五物汤（美容方）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-zvbvbqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-zvbvbqa","updated":"20231008152107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"143、狐臭\\肥胖水肿：防己黄芪汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-4k4m73w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-4k4m73w","updated":"20231008152108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"144、外伤、发炎：生肌散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-vi2dr61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-vi2dr61","updated":"20231008152109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"145、痔疮：益痔散；枳壳和黄芪（升提）；当归赤豆散；黄土汤加当归赤豆散；清肠饮；秦艽白术丸；（痔疮红肿痛，可加味槐花、槐角、地榆类药味；清热消炎则黄芩、黄莲、知母、黄柏；有肠风则秦艽、防风类药味；大便干、硬、痛则可加地黄当归芍药类通润药或枳壳类宽肠药；）"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-pf004b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-pf004b6","updated":"20231008152109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146、慢性衰弱症：黄芪糯米粥（黄芪该药要久服才能断根，该方也用于水肿病、慢性肾炎、）；黄芪加薏苡仁加红豆；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-4gcwu7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-4gcwu7e","updated":"20231008152110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147、排尿时尿道痛如刀割（老人，体虚）：黄芪一两、甘草八钱；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hhyazyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hhyazyw","updated":"20231008152111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148、中风：补阳还五汤；黄芪五物汤；续命汤；十宣放血（把病人五个手指抓起来，很快刺完，握住一挤血就出来了）；清营汤（血热中风）；续命汤4+葛根汤3+大秦椒汤3科中按比例弄一罐，每天都吃，有相当清楚疗效，其中一个月以内中风服用效果明显，六个月以内能恢复八九成，六个月以上就比较难见效果；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-1qxbz04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-1qxbz04","updated":"20231008152112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148.1、中风\\脑梗死\\脑溢血:续命汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-gl5l905","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-gl5l905","updated":"20231008152113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148.2、中风且病人不清醒的状态：三生饮（生天南星、生半夏、生川乌；三物磨粉后，用150公克蜜蜂水煮，再加一两菖蒲跟0.5公克麝香；就是把人救醒，再用续命汤，效果会比较好）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-rrlnafy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-rrlnafy","updated":"20231008152115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"149、骨质酥松：黄芪五物汤加减（可加味补骨的中药）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-h8szcvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-h8szcvf","updated":"20231008152116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"150、补药：小建中汤、黄芪五物汤、桂枝加龙骨牡蛎汤、天雄散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-dj6f84f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-dj6f84f","updated":"20231008152117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"151、不孕：真武汤（体质太湿）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-5910msz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-5910msz","updated":"20231008152117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"152、梦遗：桂枝加龙骨牡蛎汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-2bb2acw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-2bb2acw","updated":"20231008152118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"153、脱发：桂枝加龙骨牡蛎汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-g5tvldt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-g5tvldt","updated":"20231008152119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"154、清肝解毒：半夏泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ckc6nxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ckc6nxh","updated":"20231008152120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"155、保肝养肝：小建中汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ttvhgt4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ttvhgt4","updated":"20231008152120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"156、小儿百病：黄芪建中汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-zat82r8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-zat82r8","updated":"20231008152124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"157、补精：肾气丸；天雄散；桂枝龙牡汤；真武汤"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-pwahfn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-pwahfn2","updated":"20231008152124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"158、降血糖（方剂中存在石膏、附子）：真武汤加石膏；白虎汤加附子；（血糖高是五脏阳虚六腑在烧，石膏清热；附子则补五脏阳气；）"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-pydbejj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-pydbejj","updated":"20231008152126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159、补肾：肾气丸；当归生姜羊肉汤；山药羊肉肉苁蓉汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-i1kt3ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-i1kt3ff","updated":"20231008152125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"160、僵直性脊椎炎/整条背脊骨痛且不舒服：润河汤；桂枝芍药知母汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-w35x38x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-w35x38x","updated":"20231008152128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"161、妊娠毒血症：肾气丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-tloolad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-tloolad","updated":"20231008152131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"162、口疮：黄连相关药味（上火）；当归补血汤（血虚，可加点补中益气汤）；附子理中汤（脾胃寒导致阳气上浮）；甘草泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kxpa97f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kxpa97f","updated":"20231008152132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"163、鼻窦炎：葛根汤加石膏桔梗（急性鼻窦炎）；辛夷散（慢性）；苍耳散（慢性）；鼻凉汤（慢性）；（苍术、菖蒲、辛夷）；如以上无用，可考虑从虚劳治；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-t1fxcph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-t1fxcph","updated":"20231129110154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"164、艾滋病：虚劳型-附子理中汤-大发带状疱疹-转龙胆泻肝汤加减；白虎汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-pwpv8jp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-pwpv8jp","updated":"20231008152134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"165、痛风：甘草附子汤；大小八风散；桂枝芍药知母汤（疼痛的地方比较热，热肿）；乌头汤（疼痛的地方比较冷）；防己汤（剧痛到人会惨叫或痛到叫不出来的痛风；）；甘草麻黄汤（痛、肿、小便不利；发汗排毒）；越婢加白术汤（发汗清热）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-vw8d6uy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-vw8d6uy","updated":"20231008152134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"166、狐惑症/迷心失神被迷惑附身：甘草泻心汤；当归赤豆散（烂前阴后阴或有疮有脓）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-68ivozr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-68ivozr","updated":"20231008152145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"167、毒疫、鼠疫：五香连翘汤；升麻鳖甲汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kzmd1hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kzmd1hn","updated":"20231008152146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"168、瘰疬：荆防败毒散；五香连翘汤加白芥子；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-k94v1c6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-k94v1c6","updated":"20231008152153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"169、小儿麻痹症：天王补心丹；虎潜丸（该方适用肾阴虚）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-e6oy76o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-e6oy76o","updated":"20231008152154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"170、椎间盘突出\\腰腿痛\\风湿痹痛\\补肾：独活寄生汤（下半身比较严重的风湿痹痛，如果是上半身比较严重，用三痹汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-g5p06g9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-g5p06g9","updated":"20231008152155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"171、睡觉失眠体质：酸枣仁汤（虚劳虚烦失眠）；朱鸟汤（滚来滚去激烈的烦躁失眠）；柴胡龙牡汤（神经创伤）；桂枝龙牡汤（睡觉做色情的梦）；百合汤（神经衰弱）；肾气汤（火不归源，空亢奋，头脑发热）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-8heabzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-8heabzb","updated":"20231008152159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"172、神经衰弱：百合方；或百合一两，夏枯草半两煮水喝；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-o0lvz07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-o0lvz07","updated":"20231008152201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"173、肝急/累到崩溃又睡不着：酸枣仁汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-cnygagi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-cnygagi","updated":"20231008152200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"174、皮肤某一块地方长藓容易掉皮屑：大黄蛰虫丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-r5snf97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-r5snf97","updated":"20231008152201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"175、闪腰：童子尿；正骨紫金丹加晒干的蟅虫；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-an3pmw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-an3pmw8","updated":"20231008152202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"176、断骨头：在断骨头的伤科药里加上蟅虫（土鳖虫）和自然铜；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-0rj4fhn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-0rj4fhn","updated":"20231008152203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"177、戒酒瘾：蛴螬烘干，做成粉末，喝酒时屯一点，酒瘾会越来越小。"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-phivvqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-phivvqp","updated":"20231008152217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"178、子宫痰：胃苓汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-me69tnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-me69tnf","updated":"20231008152218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"179、肝硬化：大黄蛰虫丸；刘渡舟方（柴胡6g，鳖甲15g，牡蛎15g，丹皮10g，赤芍，天花粉，麦冬，生地10g，红花，茜草6g）；旋覆花汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-8o74wfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-8o74wfb","updated":"20231008152222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"180、腹水：转气汤（桂枝去芍药加麻黄附子细辛汤）；真武汤加麻黄红参五灵脂；十枣汤（用时注意一攻一补，与当归补血汤配合用）；蝼蛄（又叫土狗，风干磨粉，退肝硬化腹水特效药）；牡蛎泽泻汤；己椒苈黄丸（通用方，针对没那么紧急的水肿，如患者脾虚可先用理中汤调补）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kymsj7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kymsj7j","updated":"20231008152223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"181、脾脏肿：鳖甲煎丸（特效药，可搭配大黄蛰虫丸服用）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-80v20nc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-80v20nc","updated":"20231008152223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"182、噎隔证（吃东西吞不下去）：小半夏汤；旋覆代赭汤；橘皮竹茹汤；理中汤（特定情况的淤血型）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-opl5zsz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-opl5zsz","updated":"20231008152225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"183、小孩晚上爱哭：方剂加知了（知了白天叫晚上休息）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-q4hl3k6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-q4hl3k6","updated":"20231008152226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"184、小孩长不高：转骨汤（可加味红曲，效果更佳）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-w68ro38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-w68ro38","updated":"20231008152227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"185、吃粽子胀肚：吃点曲；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-3agzaid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-3agzaid","updated":"20231008152228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"186、回乳（小孩断奶后奶水还多）：两钱曲调酒喝（每日两日）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-axdepqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-axdepqj","updated":"20231008152227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187、吃错药解毒：甘豆汤（甘草大豆汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-gkfhidf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-gkfhidf","updated":"20231008152229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188、减慢衰老：还少丹；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ztu3jyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ztu3jyz","updated":"20231008152230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"189、大人近视（远视看不清）：属肝阳虚，可从肾阳补起，肾阳够自然会生出肝阳；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-2qindyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-2qindyb","updated":"20231008152230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190、癌症补养丸剂：五石乌头丸；耆婆万病丸；天真丸药方跟羊肉煮（不能治好，但能让病人后续的时光没那么痛苦）；八仙膏（吃不下饭，就让病人吃八仙膏代替吃饭，比较能让胃气恢复）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-d4spnv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-d4spnv7","updated":"20231008152231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"191、硝石矾石散（效果较好的利胆药，能退骨髓热，可用胶囊吞服）：肝炎、肝硬化、轻微的腹水、胆结石；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-nx39i3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-nx39i3e","updated":"20231008152232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"192、阴道病：矾石丸（杏仁、矾石两味药，放在阴道内）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-zlvt4e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-zlvt4e2","updated":"20231008152234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"193、白矾：一钱白矾煮水，治霍乱，立即洗净肠胃；两钱白矾煮水，治砒霜中毒；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-b2fuhqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-b2fuhqm","updated":"20231008152235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"194、鬼㾏(冤亲债主缠身，病邪肾传心，心传肺，肺传肝，肝传胃；病死后会继续作弄下一个人，持续下去):獭肝散（找不到獭肝用黑猫肝也可以）；（鳗鱼对鬼㾏病有抵抗效果，可临时抑制使用，但不能让病人知道吃的是鳗鱼，否则冤亲债主邪灵会让患者禁食）；月华丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-a27ojfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-a27ojfj","updated":"20231008152236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"195、肺痨咳血：莲藕打汁，送服三七粉末（一天两钱）；白芪沙参麦冬炖猪肺；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-92vjhi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-92vjhi0","updated":"20231008152236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"196、大肠癌：大柴胡汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-uymd7hc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-uymd7hc","updated":"20231008152237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"197、腹膜炎（腐沫炎）：大陷胸汤（较猛，好的差不多换方）；小陷胸汤；荡胸汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-4fg8mx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-4fg8mx9","updated":"20231008152239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"198、胸口膈下有淤血或手术后身体积淤：复元活血汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-lyapur1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-lyapur1","updated":"20240104105829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"199、美容：茯苓粉加蜂蜜敷脸；梅子泡清酒（放进喷瓶喷脸上）；天门冬泡清酒；普济玉容散（尽量不要敷超过15分钟）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-jznkd8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-jznkd8g","updated":"20231008152240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"200、狂渴不止/热水结皮下：文蛤汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ngrkgyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ngrkgyz","updated":"20231008152241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"201、寒实结胸：白散方（三物小白散；稀饭和服，如寒实在膈之上会吐，膈之下会拉）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kbulpeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kbulpeg","updated":"20231008152242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"202、伤寒六七日，发热微恶寒，支节烦疼，微呕，心下支结，外证未去者\\风病，面目浮肿，脊痛不能正立，隐曲不利，甚则骨痿，脉沉而弦，此风邪乘肾也：柴胡桂枝汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hdwgw21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hdwgw21","updated":"20231008152244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"203、神经官能症：柴桂各半汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-a42x486","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-a42x486","updated":"20231008152246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"204、肠胃发炎：三黄泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-6ymc8br","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-6ymc8br","updated":"20231008152247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"205、解毒\\性病\\淋病\\梅毒\\疱疹\\身体溃烂如阴部痒烂之类的疾病：甘草泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-brgbou9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-brgbou9","updated":"20231008152248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"205.1、梅毒：土茯苓、黄芪、紫草煮一壶每天代水服用；当归四逆汤（炎症挂到厥阴经）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-0dmak5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-0dmak5j","updated":"20231008152249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"206.1、拉肚子（燮理升降法）：赤石脂禹余粮汤（服药下之利不止，服泻心汤没好，又用其他药下之，用理中汤没好，因为理中汤理中焦，利在下焦的原因）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-xxlzu11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-xxlzu11","updated":"20231008152250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"206.2、拉肚子（温中补虚法）：理中汤（补中焦）；四逆汤（下利清谷）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hrdj62t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hrdj62t","updated":"20231008152251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"206.3、拉肚子（涩肠固脱法）：赤石脂禹余粮汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-4vkxk8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-4vkxk8s","updated":"20231008152252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"206.4、拉肚子（利小便实大便法）：五苓散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-iat6x25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-iat6x25","updated":"20231008152253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"206.5、拉肚子（逆流挽舟法）：葛根芩连汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-g4c7rrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-g4c7rrd","updated":"20231008152253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"207.6、拉肚子（偏方）：赤石脂加灶心黄土（药店叫伏龙肝）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-eid4km9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-eid4km9","updated":"20231008152254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"207.7、拉肚子：理中汤（水泻）；四逆汤（下利清谷）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-oh2gse0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-oh2gse0","updated":"20231008152256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"207、脑震荡：代赭石一百公克煮成一碗水，四小时内喝完（突然摔伤）；潜阳丹和封髓丹；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kxqudau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kxqudau","updated":"20231008152258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"208、粪从口出：芒硝煮萝卜；大柴胡汤；旋覆花加蜣螂（屎壳郎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-vrv6jc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-vrv6jc8","updated":"20231008152257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"209、噤口痢：（拉肚子同时痢疾痛，什么东西都吃不下，吃什么都吐，最后拉到最后脱水而死）：大柴胡汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-0ovcgrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-0ovcgrg","updated":"20231008152259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"210、身体组织开始纤维化：瓜蒂（特效药，也是肝硬化很好的保肝药）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-klqxudx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-klqxudx","updated":"20231008152300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"211、黄疸：麻黄连翘赤小豆汤（溶血型黄疸）；赤小豆末跟瓜蒂末一起吹到鼻中，流着鼻涕会慢慢好；大黄芒硝汤（胆管阻塞 ）；茵陈蒿汤（胆管阻塞，会便秘，大便发白）；栀子柏皮汤（无便秘用，大便发白）；（注：治黄病需耐心）"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-1flm4bi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-1flm4bi","updated":"20231008152301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"212、鼻息肉：瓜蒂跟细辛等分为末，用棉花裹住塞到鼻孔里面去；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-26mgrai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-26mgrai","updated":"20231008152302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"213、皮肤底下的纤维瘤：南瓜蒂烤焦打粉，和烈酒吞服，连续数周；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-agpxwj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-agpxwj8","updated":"20231008152304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"214、肛门肿痛便血：当归赤豆散；麻黄连翘赤小豆汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-upytku3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-upytku3","updated":"20231008152302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"215、胃口不好，易抽筋：备化汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-k3q2xvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-k3q2xvt","updated":"20231008152304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"216、小便不利：猪苓汤（偏热，尿茶色或带血；渴，躁烦，呕吐，失眠）；五苓散（膀胱气化能力差）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-0ped4rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-0ped4rt","updated":"20231008152306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"217、猪苓汤：血尿，尿道发炎，肾结石，尿路结石代表方剂；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-xjt6tq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-xjt6tq3","updated":"20231008152307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"218、噤口痢（又呕吐又下利）：小柴胡汤加石膏（更适用大人）；大柴胡汤（更适用大人）；小柴胡汤加芍药（更适用小孩）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-fyglrjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-fyglrjh","updated":"20231008152307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"219、湿热郁结型青春痘：茵陈蒿汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-mqp7tj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-mqp7tj0","updated":"20231008152308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"220、吃了饭就想吐：吴茱萸汤（若无效，换小半夏汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-gvbzz9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-gvbzz9p","updated":"20231008152309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"221、妇女保健良方：中将汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-wjwx0kz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-wjwx0kz","updated":"20231008152310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"222、头顶痛：乌梅丸；吴茱萸汤；当归四逆汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-58qlvqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-58qlvqt","updated":"20231008152312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"223、头痛吐酸水：吴茱萸汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-d4drvd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-d4drvd0","updated":"20231008152312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"224、解酒药：葛根芩连汤（解湿热类型的酒）；三黄泻心汤（解湿热类型的酒）；吴茱萸（湿寒类型的酒如啤酒）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hnwq82a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hnwq82a","updated":"20231008152313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"225、宫颈糜烂：当归四逆加吴茱萸生姜汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-f2kikh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-f2kikh3","updated":"20231008152314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"226、萎缩性胃炎：吴茱萸汤（吃冰或凉的容易发作时）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-e4cfuma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-e4cfuma","updated":"20231008152315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"227、阳明病，发热汗多者，急下之，宜大承气汤；大汗淋漓的发热，不宜白虎汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kubasfh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kubasfh","updated":"20231008152316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"228、湿热、毒气、浊气缠身：十六味流气饮；五香连翘汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-mc3jc4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-mc3jc4q","updated":"20231008152317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"229、腹股沟或颈部淋巴结块：药方加味连翘1两，玄参跟夏枯草各5钱，浙贝母3钱；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-m4itshj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-m4itshj","updated":"20231008152318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"230、二妙散（黄檗、苍术）：治下焦湿热；风湿；小便赤痛或黄带；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-y4p0gng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-y4p0gng","updated":"20231008152319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"231、风湿：白术附子桂枝麻黄汤；二两木通煮水（治发炎的风湿痛）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-a6fjjgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-a6fjjgy","updated":"20231008152319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"232、小半夏汤：不说治愈，有时候小半夏汤可以将食道癌、胃癌症状缓解；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-oor234u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-oor234u","updated":"20231008152320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"233、脑瘤：土茯苓、辛夷、鱼脑石、苍耳子、陈皮、蔓月子、白僵蚕、泽泻、白附子，煮水长服；每天7公克菖蒲煮水当茶持续喝，久服半年；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-3cm49xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-3cm49xr","updated":"20231008152322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"234、三叉神经痛：偏正头风散；散偏汤；二黄泻心汤；三黄泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-zpakjm0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-zpakjm0","updated":"20231008152323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"235、鼻炎\\鼻子过敏（中焦虚寒的人容易鼻子过敏，暖中焦的药要慢慢吃才会好）：理中汤（可加味茯苓白芍）；小建中汤（可加味干姜附子）；吴茱萸汤（需有吴茱萸汤证）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-bbohedn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-bbohedn","updated":"20231008152323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"236、逸病（过于安逸导致的病）：理中汤；黄芪五物汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-5cfun6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-5cfun6t","updated":"20231008152324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"237、胃下垂、子宫下垂：大建中汤；枳实跟黄芪并用方剂；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-rel5hpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-rel5hpy","updated":"20231008152325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"238、克隆氏病：大建中汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kfqk9tq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kfqk9tq","updated":"20231008152326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"239、慢性肾炎、尿毒症：大黄附子细辛汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-7wfkfov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-7wfkfov","updated":"20231008152327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"240、坐骨神经痛：当归四逆汤；芍药甘草汤；麻黄附子细辛汤合芍药甘草汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-dumytl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-dumytl5","updated":"20231008152328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"241、被毒蛇咬中毒：生草乌沾酒，在伤口周围涂一圈（民间方）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ypvd4ig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ypvd4ig","updated":"20231008152330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"242、离魂病：佩戴朱砂饰品；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ea8k3mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ea8k3mc","updated":"20231008152332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"243、身体动不动有淤青淤紫\\子宫发育不全\\虚寒型便秘：当归生姜羊肉汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-17e3emz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-17e3emz","updated":"20231008152333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"244、肩周炎：柴桂各半汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-u4bdzow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-u4bdzow","updated":"20231008152333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"245、慢性肝炎：柴桂各半汤加味化瘀药；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-2lf1xaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-2lf1xaf","updated":"20231008152334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"246、肠胃寒消化道不动：走马汤（热下法）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-si4jbkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-si4jbkk","updated":"20231008152335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"247、阳明宿食病：大承气汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-8undd3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-8undd3n","updated":"20231008152336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"248、太阴病，渴欲饮水，饮水即吐，此为水在膈上：半夏茯苓汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-a92ecwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-a92ecwc","updated":"20231008152336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"249、太阴病，下利，口渴，脉虚而微数者，此为津液伤也：人参白术芍药甘草汤"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-yantp0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-yantp0t","updated":"20231008152337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"250、牙龈流血：姜桂附类方剂，从肾阳虚衰、阳气不归位角度对治；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hmhsj9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hmhsj9p","updated":"20231008152338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"251、惊风型风痰造成的中风证（一个人忽然之间倒下去）：乌梅粉，擦于牙龈肉上面，能把肝风收下去(急救方);"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-773lt4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-773lt4p","updated":"20231008152339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"252、子宫息肉：乌梅用250 克、白蚕 200 克、桔梗 200 克、丹参250克、生甘草30克。打粉，每日三次，每次三钱，有概率能好；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-mhv4ulm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-mhv4ulm","updated":"20231008152340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"253、止吐：止吐药味中可加味4g乌梅和4g硼砂，效果显著；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-zvf08ry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-zvf08ry","updated":"20231008152343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"254、硬皮病：大黄蛰虫丸；当归四逆汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-2wwiaw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-2wwiaw7","updated":"20231008152344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"255、冻疮：当归四逆汤（先熏后洗，药的蒸汽熏，煮好后用药洗）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-akr0ixb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-akr0ixb","updated":"20231008152347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"256、坐骨神经痛：当归四逆汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ndyemmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ndyemmr","updated":"20231008152348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"257、子宫出血：二两天门冬与一两红糖煮水，一天三次，一天喝完；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-4zh1ncl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-4zh1ncl","updated":"20231008152348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"258、肝脏有毒：重用升麻，从解毒上来说，升麻是强有力的保肝药；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-z6p1zyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-z6p1zyv","updated":"20231008152349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"259、思虑伤魂：鹿角胶化酒吞服，每次三钱鹿角胶，蒸锅蒸融于酒中，然后喝那个酒，一天三次，空腹服用；鹿角磨粉和酒吞服；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-e5y50zt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-e5y50zt","updated":"20231008152350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"260、养生方1：人参 15g、枸杞30g、鹿角胶 24g、龟板胶 16g，泡在两公升的黄酒里面，那调融之后就这么一小杯地喝；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-p26aqip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-p26aqip","updated":"20231008152353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"261、瘿气（身上长出一块肉）：二两白头翁煮酒；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-r0gfx58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-r0gfx58","updated":"20231008152420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"262、阴道滴虫：白头翁汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-5f29luv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-5f29luv","updated":"20231008152421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"263、呕吐：小半夏汤（吐后不渴）；小半夏加茯苓汤（吐后口渴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-4fqglom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-4fqglom","updated":"20231008152422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"264、小儿厌食症：大黄甘草汤"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-u0ysjqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-u0ysjqk","updated":"20231008152422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"265、风湿、肩膀酸痛：理中甘草汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-19c4e2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-19c4e2x","updated":"20231008152423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"266、痢疾：白芍3两、当归3两、萝卜籽1两、枳壳3钱、槟榔3钱、甘草3钱、车前子3钱（缘觉神放，有说法怀孕八个月妇人得了痢疾，都能用此方保胎治病）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-oyq7h27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-oyq7h27","updated":"20231008152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"267、睾丸大小或上下不齐：蜘蛛散；暖厥阴的药味如吴茱萸汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-rzr3haa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-rzr3haa","updated":"20231008152424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"268、口渴饮水不止：文蛤散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-7e7yxaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-7e7yxaf","updated":"20231008152425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"268.1、消渴，食量饮水量过大：文蛤汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ny9ohqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ny9ohqb","updated":"20231008152427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"268.2、消渴，想喝水，喝了一阵子反而吐出来：茯苓泽泻汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-8m84gtm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-8m84gtm","updated":"20231008152427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"269、尿毒症：栝蒌翟麦丸（上焦热下焦寒）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-x4gwnam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-x4gwnam","updated":"20231008152428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"270、尿道炎：蒲灰散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-5wgphfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-5wgphfz","updated":"20231008152428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"271、肝硬化腹水类或其他的水肿：十斤菖蒲烧灰，调麻油，给病人抹全身，据说水肿马上就退；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-4aygc3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-4aygc3s","updated":"20231008152429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"272、增强记忆力：定志小丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-o6dnntf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-o6dnntf","updated":"20231008152430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"273、眼底出血：一味蒲黄，泡茶喝；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-6m2idry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-6m2idry","updated":"20231008152430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"274、摄护腺发炎导致的小便不通：通关丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-4hzszkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-4hzszkk","updated":"20231008152432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"275、霍乱：理中汤；白术茯苓半夏枳实汤；明矾调水喝；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-qu389lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-qu389lf","updated":"20231008152431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"276、湿气重、身烦疼：麻黄加术汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-osf2nd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-osf2nd1","updated":"20231008152433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"276.1、风湿：麻黄加术汤（脉浮缓）；越婢加术汤（脉浮紧）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-656c0er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-656c0er","updated":"20231008152435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"276.2、风湿，肌肉酸疼：麻杏薏甘汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-f0i2t8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-f0i2t8x","updated":"20231008152435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"277、狐臭、皮肤偏黑、眼眶黑斑，水毒型肥，汗腐臭味：防己黄芪汤（该方久用易肾虚，可间断服用真武汤、肾气丸之类的方）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-f1ooq9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-f1ooq9v","updated":"20231008152437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"278、发癫：防己地黄汤加味桂枝防风和防己；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-oehw6mt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-oehw6mt","updated":"20231008152436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"279、视线模糊：决明子（炒熟泡茶）;"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-2rlrck0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-2rlrck0","updated":"20240226172054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"280、嗳气不出：旋覆代赭汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-f4tjvbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-f4tjvbw","updated":"20240226172052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"281、久病必瘀（泛指之方）：血府逐瘀汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-fkyjrr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-fkyjrr4","updated":"20240226172102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"282、心痛彻背，背痛彻心（胸痹）：乌头赤石脂丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kbep2qr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kbep2qr","updated":"20240226172104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"283、精神病：桃核承气汤（暴力型）；抵当汤（暴力型）；甘麦大枣汤；柴胡龙牡汤（精神离散）；桂枝救逆汤（精神离散）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-menm439","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-menm439","updated":"20240226172105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"284、解春药之毒：百合相关的方；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-hzk29au","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-hzk29au","updated":"20240226172107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"285、小便时头晕或头痛：百合地黄汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-rp8r1yp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-rp8r1yp","updated":"20240226172108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"286、练气功练出问题，说话时不时膈气出来：有概率是百合病，可从百合病对治；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-6jruobj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-6jruobj","updated":"20240226172109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"287、急性肝炎：每天四公克苦参粉，装成胶囊，分成几次来吞掉；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ofclx6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ofclx6u","updated":"20240226172110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"288、肠胃道出血：黄土汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-36ps85m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-36ps85m","updated":"20240226172111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"289、红斑狼疮、鼠疫：升麻鳖甲汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-b3um1mu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-b3um1mu","updated":"20240226172112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"290、补任督二脉：龟鹿二仙胶（乌龟能量集中在任脉，鹿能量集中在督脉）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-q5ag3js","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-q5ag3js","updated":"20240226172112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"291、疟疾、截疟：常山末两钱酒炒透，加四颗乌梅肉做成药丸吞服；柴胡两钱、常山一钱酒炒透，草果仁一钱半，槟榔两钱，栀子一钱半；白虎桂枝汤（往来寒热，汗出恶风脉洪滑）；蜀漆散（吐药）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-9qowlc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-9qowlc5","updated":"20240226172116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"292、某种疮，里面有骨头的碎片：推车散（该药方内有蜣螂，能把脏东西拔出）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-p1oytmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-p1oytmx","updated":"20240226172117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"293、卵巢肿：鳖甲煎丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-gua43q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-gua43q1","updated":"20240226172118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"294、热性关节炎：白虎桂枝汤；桂枝芍药知母汤（关节发炎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-5hsnosq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-5hsnosq","updated":"20240226172119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"295、膀胱咳（咳而漏尿）：苓桂术甘汤；真武汤加生脉散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-1o3rfiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-1o3rfiw","updated":"20240226172120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"296、眼睛发炎或眼睛痛：苓桂术甘汤加车前子；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-n43ovq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-n43ovq4","updated":"20240226172121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"297、乳癌\\乳瘤\\虚劳型咳血\\翻花疮\\舌疽：转气汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-ayd9uk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-ayd9uk4","updated":"20240226172126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"298、关节变形：乌头汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-kod24e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-kod24e2","updated":"20240226172127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"299、失心疯、病如狂状，独语不休（自己跟自己说话）：防己地黄汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-z4tp3dt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-z4tp3dt","updated":"20240226172135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"300、脚气：矾石汤；崔氏八味丸；鸡鸣散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-klckoo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-klckoo1","updated":"20240226172138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"301、补中焦阳气：四逆汤；术附汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-bp8goe4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-bp8goe4","updated":"20240226172139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"302、心下悸：半夏麻黄丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-7xbsogb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-7xbsogb","updated":"20240226172140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"303、吐血、止血药：柏叶汤（吐血不止）；黄土汤（吐血不止）；二黄泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-84wdtdo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-84wdtdo","updated":"20240226172140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"304、止吐药：伏龙肝（灶中黄土，也叫灶心土，最强止吐药之一）煮水（该方可用于小产流血保胎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-91fe7mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-91fe7mp","updated":"20240226172141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"305、胃癌：黄土汤跟吴茱萸汤合方（倪海厦用药规律）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-4etkzcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-4etkzcw","updated":"20240226172142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"306、浸淫疮（往四肢蔓延的脓疮）：黄连粉；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152919-1m20txg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152919-1m20txg","updated":"20240226172143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"307、脱疽、坏疽：四妙永安汤；"}]},{"ID":"20231012110707-h9qv1h4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012110707-h9qv1h4","updated":"20240226172144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"308、面口中风、口歪眼斜：敷鳝鱼血，敷在患侧（即没有歪的那一边）；"}]},{"ID":"20231013093330-qshxl8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231013093330-qshxl8v","updated":"20240226172145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"309、褥疮（躺太久背生疮）：蒲黄跟菖蒲等份磨粉做痱子粉呢是治疗那个褥疮的特效药"}]},{"ID":"20231012110725-a21qr2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231012110725-a21qr2b","updated":"20240226172146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"310、生脉散：调和麻黄副作用；"}]},{"ID":"20240103112426-rphv22l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240103112426-rphv22l","updated":"20240226172147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"311、糖尿病焦黑肿无法走路：顾步汤（若无效可加味乳香末药，让药性走的通些）；"}]},{"ID":"20240103113403-ppzhpiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240103113403-ppzhpiq","updated":"20240226172147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"312、消化不良：锅巴磨粉吞服；"}]},{"ID":"20240226082235-cxd5bm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226082235-cxd5bm9"}}]}